# Flutter & Dart Course — Coding Tests (Week 2 → Week 7)

This repository tracks my practice and retakes of the coding tests from my Dart / Flutter course.
Each week tests one skill, and every group (G1–G4) in a week is the **same exercise with a different story**.

## Repository structure

```
.
├── WEEK-2/                # Dart functions & parameters
│   ├── test-g1/           # Employee Bonus
│   ├── test-g2/           # Delivery Charges
│   ├── test-g3/           # Online Order Price
│   └── test-g4/           # Cinema Tickets
├── WEEK-3/                # Classes & OOP (written test, .docx instructions)
├── WEEK-4/                # Layered architecture: Model → Service → Test
│   ├── W4 - TEST - G1/    # The Library
│   ├── W4 - TEST - G2/    # The Cinema
│   ├── W4 - TEST - G3/    # The Delivery
│   ├── W4 - TEST - G4/    # The Appointments
│   └── W4 - TEST - RETAKE/# The Sports Center
├── WEEK-6/                # Flutter layout (Row, Column, Expanded)
│   ├── G1/ G2/ G3/ G4/
└── WEEK-7/                # Flutter stateless widgets (cards)
    ├── G1/ G2/ G3/ G4/
```

## Exercises

### Week 2 — Dart functions & parameters

Write one function with the correct parameter syntax (required, optional with default, nullable), then loop over the data in `main()` and print the results.

| Group | Exercise | Function | Data to loop over |
|---|---|---|---|
| G1 | Employee Bonus | `calculateBonus` | Two parallel lists |
| G2 | Delivery Charges | `calculateDelivery` | `Map<String, int>` |
| G3 | Online Order Price | `calculateFinalPrice` | Two parallel lists (one nullable) |
| G4 | Cinema Tickets | `calculateTicketPrice` | `List<Map<String, dynamic>>` |

**Run:** `dart test.dart`

### Week 3 — Classes & OOP

Model a small system with classes, enums, default values, immutability and a computed getter, then test it in `main()`.

| Group | Exercise | Main concepts |
|---|---|---|
| G1 | Fast-Food Order | Enums with prices, `Set` for unique extras |
| G2 | Bus Ticket | Immutable class, "upgrade" returns a new object |
| G3 | Student Report | Private list, add later, average & best subject |
| G4 | Train Trip | Custom `Duration` with `operator +` and `toString()` |
| Extra | Hospital Patients | Filtering a list with `where` |

**Run:** `dart <file>.dart`

### Week 4 — Model → Service → Test

Starter code is given. Add a new business rule in three layers:
Q1 Model (field + getter) · Q2 Service (precondition that throws an `Exception`) · Q3 Tests (one valid, one invalid).

| Group | Exercise | New rule |
|---|---|---|
| G1 | The Library | Borrowing limit (regular 2 / premium 4) |
| G2 | The Cinema | Minimum age for movies |
| G3 | The Delivery | Maximum weight per truck |
| G4 | The Appointments | Cancelling an appointment |
| Retake | The Sports Center | Booking a court by time slot |

**Run:**

```bash
dart pub get
dart test lib/test/<name>_test.dart
```

### Week 6 — Flutter layout

Build a coloured-box layout from an ASCII diagram using `Row`, `Column`, `Container`, `Expanded` (flex) and `SizedBox` (gaps). The layout must adapt to any screen width.

| Group | Theme | Root widget |
|---|---|---|
| G1 | Layout exercise | `Column` |
| G2 | Music player | `Row` |
| G3 | Photo gallery | `Column` |
| G4 | Online shop | `Column` |

### Week 7 — Stateless widgets

Build a reusable stateless card widget from an enum and one `bool`, then show a list of cards.

| Group | Widget | Bool | Effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| G1 | `MemberCard` | `isSelected` | Blue background |
| G2 | `ProductCard` | `isOnSale` | Half price |
| G3 | `SportCard` | `isFavorite` | Filled star |
| G4 | `DeviceCard` | `isOn` | Amber avatar |

**Run (Week 6 & 7):**

```bash
flutter create --platforms=web .
flutter pub get
flutter run -d chrome
```

