## Notes

- The `WEEK-2/test-g3/test.dart` starter contains the G2 data by mistake; the real G3 data is in the `.docx` instructions.
- In Week 4, the test files are in `lib/test/`, so run `dart test lib/test/...` (not `test/...`).
- Week 5 is not included.

## Tools

- Dart SDK 3.x
- Flutter (web target, Chrome)
- VS Code